       "<strong>Monitor / Analyse</strong> — measure performance and explain variance.",
       "<strong>Act / Adjust</strong> — take corrective action and feed learning back into strategy.",
       "The Balanced Scorecard was introduced by <strong>Kaplan and Norton (1992)</strong> to prevent short-term financial myopia."
